    "doc": "Final order · 14 January 2022 · para 115",
    "quote": "the de facto price in the market",
    "quoteKey": "q",
    "credit": "CCI ORDER, CASE NOS. 09 AND 36 OF 2017",
    "creditKey": "c",
    "label": "DRAWING, NOT THE ORDER'S PAGE"
   },
   "vo": "In January twenty twenty two the Commission found that the committee's price is the de facto price in the market, because no other body in India declares one. Fifty years earlier, nobody wanted their eggs. Now nobody else was naming a price.",
