   "vo": "It held that trying to enforce the price, with penalties or the threat of them, broke the competition law. It ordered an end to such threats, and told the committee to call its prices only suggestive. It imposed no fine. An appeal asking for penalties was dismissed by the tribunal, and a further appeal is pending in the Supreme Court.",
